<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise/Suez holds 1997 profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise/Suez holds 1997 profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokeswoman for the newly-merged Lyonnaise des Eaux and Cie de Suez utilities group said on Thursday it was maintaining its forecast for a net attributable profit of 3.5 billion francs for 1997.</p>
<p>The forecast took into account the impact of the windfall tax on utilities levied by the British government in Wednesday's budget.</p>
</text>
